flowchart TD
  A([Start: Candidate accepts offer]) --> B[HR enters employee data manually]
  B --> C[HR emails onboarding form to manager]
  C --> D{Manager approves?}
  D -- No --> E[Manager requests corrections]
  E --> B
  D -- Yes --> F[HR emails approved details to IT]
  F --> G[IT manually creates account]
  G --> H[IT manually assigns role/access]
  H --> I[IT emails confirmation to HR and manager]
  I --> J([End])
